## Area 1: Benchmark Comparison Engine

> *"Evaluate the effectiveness of AI-assisted design recommendations against conventional manual approaches"*

### 1.1 Concept
Allow users to compare the AI-generated architecture against a **Reference Blueprint** (Baseline) from the MongoDB knowledge base. The system will:
1. Auto-match the closest `ReferenceBlueprint` based on context similarity.
2. Compute a **node-level accuracy score** (how many nodes match the expert baseline).
3. Display a **side-by-side Radar Chart** comparing AI scores vs. Baseline scores.

